        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha?! Hand-to-hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Just a quick whiff of tobacco is enough to pump me up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I'm sorry to say, we may be about to have an 'accident' here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it, let go! Are... Are you trying to kill me? Gah\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, just a 'slip' of the hand\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Finished. There were only a few of them, and the rest ran off, leaving this poor fella alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you kill him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It would be nice if the good doctors could wake him up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's breathing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's make sure we're saving lives now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll have words for you soon, 'Schultz.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. I'm all ears, Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you before, I'm not 'Sir.' I'm not your Schultz when we're alone. I'm Thor's father, and your uncle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Sir, you just... you were going to kill that Infected man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't deny it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's only going to make things worse! And you can't attack a member of the Wolumonde family so lightly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if he told the militants that we're defenseless?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what this means, Tatjana.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You should have a heart, at least\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't always make the right choice, no matter how much you might want to. Not unless you're omniscient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Objectively speaking, if a prophet or a banker baron told me just a few deaths would bring peace back to Wolumonde...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd do it. No matter who had to die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Even if...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Matter. Who.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "...At least he managed to hold on to his life. That's good enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get back to Rhodes Island. Did you tell them the truth? Did you already take them to the camp? That girl had a different look in her eye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You already knew...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was pretty sure. For what it's worth, I never saw the point in hiding it from them. But keeping it under wraps myself calmed a lot of people down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your read on them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think they'll help Wolumonde. They're the same kind of people as Dr. Atro.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*, *hack*. And you think they speak for all of Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're the ones they sent. So I guess they should be decently representative?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Truth be told, if every Rhodes Island operator we ran into turned out to be a good person, that would disturb me a lot more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm thinking back... to a certain sniper. She was from Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The one who came with Dr. Atro and left shortly thereafter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope she didn't get swallowed up by the Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
