        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at it. A beautiful, empty town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde. Moon of the Winterwisp Mountains. Yes, truly worthy of its name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A moon? Pfah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Four of our people died in that fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "And they have the gall to try to pin it on the Infected? What's next? Where do they go from here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do they just expect us to turn the other cheek?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're quite worked up. Try to relax. You don't usually talk like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We should level this place! Damned Wolumonders! Damned immigrants!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mudrock! You and your Sarkaz could do it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right... Who knows the pain of losing one's home better than the Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even in Leithanien, where the Infected are supposed to be able to do what they can with what they have, there is no place for the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But, the cupcakes that nice granny gave us were delicious. Just the right amount of sweet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Armed Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... We wait. The only thing we're here to destroy is the murderer. We can't lose control of our hate. Or else...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "What separates us from what we were before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
